{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {

    },
    "“敬語ボタン”に\nフルアクセスを許可しますか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allow Full Access for\n“敬語ボタン”?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要允许“敬語ボタン”\n完全访问吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[プライバシーポリシー](%@)の内容に同意します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I agree to the [Privacy Policy](%@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我同意[隐私政策](%@)的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」ボタン" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” button"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”按钮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「敬語」ボタンの変換のしかたを変えたり、よく使う言い換えを自分のボタンとして追加できます。設定の「プロンプト」からいつでも編集できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change how the “Keigo” button converts text, or add frequently used rephrasings as your own buttons. Edit them anytime from “Prompts” in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以更改“敬语”按钮的转换方式，或将常用的改写添加为自己的按钮。可随时在设置的“提示词”中编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「敬語」ボタンの変換内容を自分好みに編集" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Edit how the “Keigo” button converts to your liking"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你的喜好编辑“敬语”按钮的转换内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【任意】日本語AIの改善に協力する" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "(Optional) Help improve Japanese AI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "（可选）协助改进日语 AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@回書き直し" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ rewrites"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 次重写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "※ お試し用の入力欄です。入力した文章はどこにも送信されません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "* This is a trial input field. What you type is not sent anywhere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "* 这是试用输入框。你输入的内容不会发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "© 2026 敬語ボタン" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "10キー入力" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10-key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10 键输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10キー配列でフリック入力" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flick typing on a 10-key layout"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 10 键布局上使用 flick 输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10キー配列のフリック入力に対応しました。ローマ字と同じように、AIボタンや返信もそのまま使えます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flick input on a 10-key layout is now supported. Just like romaji, the AI button and replies work the same way."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现已支持 10 键布局的 flick 输入。与罗马字一样，AI 按钮和回复都可照常使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIサービスに送信される内容" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What is sent to the AI service"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送给 AI 服务的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIで敬語・ビジネス文面に書き直し" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rewrite into keigo and business wording with AI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 AI 改写为敬语和商务措辞"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIで書き直すために必要です。通常の入力中に勝手に送信されることはありません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Needed for AI rewriting. Nothing is sent on its own while you type normally."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 改写需要此权限。日常输入时绝不会自动发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIによるかな漢字変換を搭載しました。文脈を読んで、より自然な変換候補を提案します。すべて端末内で動作し、入力内容が送信されることはありません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kana-kanji conversion is now powered by AI. It reads the context and suggests more natural candidates. Everything runs on your device — nothing you type is ever sent anywhere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搭载了 AI 假名汉字转换。根据上下文提供更自然的候选词。全部在设备内运行，输入内容绝不会被发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIに送る前に\n確認してください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Please review\nbefore sending to AI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送给 AI 前\n请先确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIの書き直し・返信はそのまま使える" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI rewrite and replies work as before"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 改写和回复照常可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIボタンで\n書き換えてみましょう" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rewrite it\nwith an AI button"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 AI 按钮\n改写试试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIボタンをドラッグして並べ替えたり、使わないボタンを削除したり。自分の使い方に合わせて自由に整理できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag AI buttons to reorder them, delete the ones you don't use — organize them to match how you write."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动 AI 按钮排序，删除不需要的按钮，按自己的使用习惯自由整理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIボタンを押した文章だけ書き直します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rewrite text instantly with AI button"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅改写你点击 AI 按钮的文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIボタンを押した時だけ、今の文章を敬語に書き直します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your text is rewritten politely only when you tap an AI button."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在按下 AI 按钮时，才会将当前文字改写为敬语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIボタンを押すと、その部分だけを書き直し" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap an AI button to rewrite only that part"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按下 AI 按钮，只改写该部分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AIボタンを押すと、今の文章に合う自然な候補をすぐ選べます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the AI button to instantly pick natural suggestions that fit your text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点击 AI 按钮，即可立即选择契合当前文本的自然候选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI変換とプライバシー" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
